 To push the `mnpStatus` variable into the specific object in the `registrations` array, you need to use the `setState` function with a callback after making an API call. Here's how you can modify your `checkMNPStatusAPI` function to achieve this:

```javascript
checkMNPStatusAPI(phoneNo, index) {
